      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……真是不简单的人格气场啊。 \n简直就像是要把胜利女神都\n一口吞下去一样的势头嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5ae4e403e9c76c6d7e4a0359c33fa1d947863f6a7c0cb36404ac9ccaf5deed4",
